    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-19T10:39:38+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-19T10:39:38+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-19T00:09:38Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-19T00:09:38Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A slow-moving high pressure system over the Tasman Sea extends a ridge over eastern SA. A trough of low pressure over western SA is moving eastwards and will reach southeastern parts later today while a weakening cold front crosses the Bight. The trough lingers in the east through the middle of the week as a weak high pressure system forms in the Bight. This trough weakens on Thursday as a second trough moves into the west from WA.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-19T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-20T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-18T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-19T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Leigh Creek. Winds northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the middle of the day. Daytime maximum temperatures 28 to 36.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 4:40pm, UV Index predicted to reach 10 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-20T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-21T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-19T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-20T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers south of Yunta, slight chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm, possibly severe with damaging winds, large hail and heavy rain which may lead to flash flooding in the afternoon. Winds east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending north to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the morning then tending southeast to southwesterly in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 15 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 29 to 38.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending southeast to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the morning then tending east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 15 and 23 with daytime temperatures reaching 29 to 37.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of morning fog south of Yunta. Slight chance of a shower north of Leigh Creek, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek in the afternoon and evening. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending north to northeasterly during the morning then tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 15 and 23 with daytime temperatures reaching 31 to 36.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
